*** Keywords ***
Start Uplink Test
    [Documentation]
    ...  Starts Uplink Test Module. It goes in two manners - if cell technology is TDD, then downlink test module is also
    ...  needed to run in parallel. FDD cells do not need such operation.
    [Arguments]                                          ${test_model}
    ...                                                  ${local_cell}
    ...                                                  ${nr_cell}
    ...                                                  ${cell_technology}
    ...                                                  ${beam_id}
    ...                                                  ${rep_time_interval}
    ...                                                  ${pmax}
    ...                                                  ${timeout}
    ...                                                  ${test_id}=1
    ...                                                  &{nrarfcn}

    Run keyword if       '${cell_technology}'=='TDD'     Run keywords
    ...   Robot Log Operation                            Starting 5G Downlink Test (NR-FR1-TM1.1) before ${test_id} Uplink Test.
    ...   AND
    ...   webui.start_5g_downlink_test                   local_cell=${local_cell}
    ...                                                  test_model=NR-FR1-TM1.1
    ...                                                  p_max=${pmax}
    ...                                                  polarization=P_both
    ...                                                  beam_id=${beam_id}
    ...                                                  timeout=${timeout}
    ...                                                  &{nrarfcn}
    ...   AND
    ...   webui.wait_for_5g_downlink_test_to_start       timeout=60
    ...                                                  test_id=${test_id}

    Robot Log Operation                          Starting ${test_id} 5G Uplink Test with ${test_model}...
    webui.start_5g_uplink_test                           local_cell=${local_cell}
    ...                                                  frc_index=${test_model}
    ...                                                  reporting_time_interval=${rep_time_interval}
    ...                                                  beam_id=${beam_id}
    ...                                                  timeout=${timeout}
    ...                                                  &{nrarfcn}
    webui.wait_for_5g_uplink_test_to_start               timeout=120
    ...                                                  test_id=${test_id}

Parse and Log Uplink WebUI Tables Content
    [Documentation]
    ...  Parses WebUI Tables that are generated during running uplink test module. Three tables are present:
    ...  Test, Cumulative and Partial Results Table.
    [Arguments]                                          ${test_id}=1
    ${webui_test_res}                                    webui.get_5g_uplink_test_parameters_table
    ...                                                  test_id=${test_id}
    Robot Log Variable                                   variable=${webui_test_res}
    ${webui_cumu_res}                                    webui.get_5g_uplink_cumulative_results_table
    ...                                                  test_id=${test_id}
    Robot Log Variable                                   variable=${webui_cumu_res}
    ${webui_part_res}                                    webui.get_5g_uplink_partial_results_table
    ...                                                  test_id=${test_id}
    Robot Log Variable                                   variable=${webui_part_res}
    [Return]                                             ${webui_test_res}
    ...                                                  ${webui_cumu_res}
    ...                                                  ${webui_part_res}

Check Unavailability Of Uplink Test Module
    [Documentation]
    ...  Checks if provided uplink test module is available in test table on WebUI.
    [Arguments]                                          ${nr_cell}
    ...                                                  ${test_model}
    ${test_available}=                                   webui.is_5g_uplink_test_available
    ...                                                  local_cell=NRCELL-${nr_cell}
    ...                                                  frc_index=${test_model}
    should not be true                                   ${test_available}

Verify Uplink Report and WebUI content
    [Documentation]
    ...  Verifies if report content and WebUI tables have the same data. Also Partial Results and Cumulative Results
    ...  Table are being validated against themselves and some requirements mentioned in QC docs.
    [Arguments]                                          ${WebUI_test_res_table}
    ...                                                  ${WebUI_cumu_res_table}
    ...                                                  ${WebUI_part_res_table}
    ...                                                  ${report_test_res_table}
    ...                                                  ${report_cum_res_table}
    ...                                                  ${report_part_res_table}
    Compare File Report with WebUI Content               WebUI_test_res_table=${WebUI_test_res_table}
    ...                                                  WebUI_cumu_res_table=${WebUI_cumu_res_table}
    ...                                                  WebUI_part_res_table=${WebUI_part_res_table}
    ...                                                  report_test_res_table=${report_test_res_table}
    ...                                                  report_cum_res_table=${report_cum_res_table}
    ...                                                  report_part_res_table=${report_part_res_table}
    Validate Tables Results and RSSI Values              WebUI_cumu_res_table=${WebUI_cumu_res_table}
    ...                                                  WebUI_part_res_table=${WebUI_part_res_table}

Uplink Test Teardown
    [Documentation]
    ...  According to different cell technologys, teardown has to be splitted via cell_technology parameter for
    ...  TDD and FDD technologies.
    ...  Rules are the same - tries to stop all running tests and refreshing page.
    [Arguments]                                          ${cell_technology}
    Run keyword if  '${cell_technology}'=='TDD'          Uplink Test Teardown TDD
    Run keyword if  '${cell_technology}'=='FDD'          Uplink Test Teardown FDD

Uplink Test Teardown TDD
    Run keywords              Run keyword and ignore error     webui.stop_5g_uplink_test
    ...                       AND
    ...                       Run keyword and ignore error     webui.wait_for_5g_uplink_test_to_stop
    ...                       AND
    ...                       Run keyword and ignore error     webui.stop_5g_downlink_test
    ...                       AND
    ...                       Run keyword and ignore error     webui.wait_for_5g_downlink_test_to_stop
    ...                       AND
    ...                       Run keyword and ignore error     webui.refresh_page
    ...                       AND
    ...                       Close Selenium Session

Uplink Test Teardown FDD
    Run keywords              Run keyword and ignore error     webui.stop_5g_uplink_test
    ...                       AND
    ...                       Run keyword and ignore error     webui.wait_for_5g_uplink_test_to_stop
    ...                       AND
    ...                       Run keyword and ignore error     webui.refresh_page
    ...                       AND
    ...                       Close Selenium Session

Wait For Uplink Test Results And Stop Test
    [Arguments]                                          ${rep_time_interval}
    ...                                                  ${measures}
    ...                                                  ${cell_technology}
    ...                                                  ${timeout}=20
    ...                                                  ${test_id}=1
    tm_startup.wait_for_test_model_results               interval=${rep_time_interval}
    ...                                                  measures=${measures}
    Run keyword if  '${cell_technology}'=='FDD'          Stop Uplink Test on FDD
    ...                                                  timeout=${timeout}
    ...                                                  test_id=${test_id}
    Run keyword if  '${cell_technology}'=='TDD'          Stop Uplink Test on TDD
    ...                                                  timeout=${timeout}
    ...                                                  test_id=${test_id}
